IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, salut, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oggi sarà buio tutto il giorno.
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Attenzione a non inciampare!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} merhaba, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bugün bütün gün karanlık olacak,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
o yüzden adımlarına dikkat et!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Düşmek yok!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Volvemos a vernos,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Si en invierno ya hace frío,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡imagínate sin el calorcito del sol!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che bello rivederti,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oggi è un giorno{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} con doppia dose di
tutto.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Doppia notte, doppio freddo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Potrei avere un caffè doppio?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Güneşin hiç doğmaması çok tuhaf.{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ama sanırım yeni şeyler denemek
de önemli, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Di nuovo tu!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}} Che giorno strano. {{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sarà notte presto, ma noi non
ce ne accorgeremo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
